          "Type": 1,
          "Text": "Lead with the incident causing the longest delay or affecting the most drivers. Cover as many named, real items as the slot word target calls for \u2014 a listener paid with dead air for a fact you were given and did not voice. Do not stop at three or four when more grounded roads are available; the slot capacity and word target already set the ceiling. Close with a short safety sign-off.",
